        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12382697/comment/12543861",
          "id": "12543861",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=fmeschbe",
            "name": "fmeschbe",
            "key": "fmeschbe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Felix Meschberger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "RepositoryUtil IMHO has two issues with regards to JCR OCM: (1) It creates a dependency on Jackrabbit-Core which is very bad and (2) it provides utility code, of which I am not sure whether it is correctly placed inside the JCR OCM. Therefore, I suggest to not move this class back into the JCR-OCM library.\n\nWhat exact functionality is ocm-spring being dependent ?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=fmeschbe",
            "name": "fmeschbe",
            "key": "fmeschbe",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Felix Meschberger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2007-11-20T11:13:16.420+0000",
          "updated": "2007-11-20T11:13:16.420+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12382697/comment/12544612",
          "id": "12544612",
          "author": {
